description:
Replace the player's character sheet. Call once character creation is agreed, or for a large revision. Keep every value you already track. Use this layout (lowercase keys, snake_case for multi-word trait names; include only abilities with dots; secondary abilities go in the matching group):
{"name": "...", "concept": "...", "clan": "...", "generation": 11, "sire": "...", "nature": "...", "demeanor": "...", "sect": "Camarilla", "embraced": "1999", "apparent_age": "mid-20s", "attributes": {"physical": {"strength": 2, "dexterity": 3, "stamina": 2}, "social": {"charisma": 3, "manipulation": 2, "appearance": 4}, "mental": {"perception": 3, "intelligence": 2, "wits": 3}}, "abilities": {"talents": {"alertness": 1, "subterfuge": 3}, "skills": {"etiquette": 2, "animal_ken": 1}, "knowledges": {"academics": 1}}, "specialties": {"etiquette": "Elysium"}, "disciplines": {"auspex": 2, "presence": 1}, "backgrounds": {"resources": 2, "contacts": 1}, "virtues": {"conscience": 3, "self_control": 3, "courage": 2}, "merits_flaws": [{"name": "Eat Food", "points": 1, "type": "merit"}, {"name": "Haunted", "points": 3, "type": "flaw"}], "humanity": 6, "willpower": 3, "willpower_max": 3, "blood": 10, "blood_max": 12, "health": {"bashing": 0, "lethal": 0, "aggravated": 0}, "experience": {"unspent": 0, "total": 0}, "weakness": "...", "rituals": [], "notes": "..."}
A character on a Path uses "path": {"name": "...", "rating": 5} instead of humanity. Possessions are not part of the sheet: track them with set_inventory and update_inventory.
